        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DDB425, Heavy Duty Solid Brass Dutch Door Bolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Deltana decorative door bolt is used on dutch doors and made of solid brass. The door bolt locks the upper and lower panels of a dutch door together. Can also be used as a (horizontal) door security bolt. Packaged includes mortise strike plate, angle strike plate, decorative guides and matching finish mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DDB425.gif?v=1704354553\" width=\"490\" height=\"214\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana DDB425 Solid Brass Dutch Door Bolt Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-dutch-door-quadrant-deltana-ddq56\"><b>Deltana Dutch Door Quadrant</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana DDB425 Dutch Door Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Length: 4-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Width: 5/8\" Diameter Half Round Rod</li>\r\n<li>Guide Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Available in 9 Finishes</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DDB425.pdf?v=1691095315\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DDB425 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
