                "title": "Solid Brass Dutch Door Bolt",
                "description": "Heavy Duty Solid Brass Dutch Door Bolt, Deltana DDB425 - This Deltana decorative door bolt is used on dutch doors and made of solid brass. The door bolt locks the upper and lower panels of a dutch door together. Can also be used as a (horizontal) door security bolt. Packaged includes mortise strike plate, angle strike plate, decorative guides and matching finish mounting hardware.",
